guide forever/alliance/skyborne/01-zephras-isle
title Zephras Isle
faction Alliance
race Skyborne
levels 1-15
zone Zephras Isle
next forever/alliance/02-westfall

# Route: the simulator's consensus route for the Alliance Skyborne
# (data/sim/export/consensus-alliance-skyborne, visit 1, levels 1-14.6).
#
# Flow: Thendal Grove (1-6) -> Shen'dar Village, the Highlands and Falaath
# Village (6-9.5) -> Valanaar and the Gustberry Lowlands (9.5-12.5) -> the
# Shrine of Akir and Shadowgale Forest (12.5-14.5) -> Valanaar -> the skycutter
# to Dalaran, Denaaris and the Skyborne portal to Stormwind at about 14.6,
# Bolvar in Stormwind Keep, then on to Westfall.
# The isle has no inn or flight master and the route sets no hearth. Every
# class trains in Thendal Grove (2, 4, 6), Shen'dar (about 9) and Valanaar
# (about 11 and 14). There are no grind stops: the quests carry you.
#
# Class quests, as class-only steps around Valanaar:
# - Hunter: Quel'ana Quickgale's Taming the Beast (94978, 94979, 94013:
#   Windsong Crawler, Vuldren Alpha, Ornery Galestrider) and Training the
#   Beast (94050) after the Valanaar turn-ins at about 11; Elayaa Easewind's
#   breadcrumb (94007) is not needed. The Way of the Hunter (92482) is
#   handed to Tai'ree Farsight in Thendal Grove at 2.
# - Warrior: The Skybreaker Bulwark (94003, Defensive Stance), Zaal
#   Stormshield at the Shrine of Akir. The data puts Zaal by Hanaa's camp in
#   Thendal Grove; the quest text and players' reports put him at the shrine.
#   The Warrior's Path (92532), Rorian to Blademaster Ren in the grove at 2.
# - Druid: The Great Ursera Spirit and Strength and Mercy (94006, 94638, Bear
#   Form) from Lotheluum Starbreeze, Urs'endris and Ur'endra. Cat Form is in
#   03-darkshore.
#   At the Dalaran landing Alfina Nightgaze's Child of Nature (94912) goes to
#   Sheldras Moontree in Stormwind, whose Moonglade (94914) teaches Teleport:
#   Moonglade; Dendrite takes it on the Cat Form trip in 03-darkshore.
# - Druid at 2: A Student of Nature (92485), Rorian to Xyton Silverwind in
#   Thendal Grove.
# - Mage: A Student of the Arcane (92481) in Thendal Grove; Speak with Belann
#   and Boughs in the Wind (93791, 93797: Windbough Wand) around Valanaar at
#   about 10; Mirror Lake (1861) from Jennea Cannon in Stormwind, its water
#   taken on the way to Westfall, handed in at the 02-westfall Stormwind stop.
# - Rogue: At Home in the Shadows (92483), Rorian to Akeri Duskblade in the
#   watchtower (no spell).
# - Level 2 class letters are taken: Rorian's note for every class (92532,
#   92482, 92483, 92481, 92485) goes to its trainer in Thendal Grove once
#   Harmony in Balance is handed in.
#
# Optional extra: WANTED: Vulgara the Insatiable (93318), not in the export;
# Vulgara is elite, so it stays an optional extra.
#
# Deviations from the export (local order only, same quest set):
# - Thendal Grove: Halaan, Myriaal, Dalia and Falorne are taken on the first
#   return to the grove; the Windstones, the Cirrusfly Queen and the Ley Line
#   go into one loop east with Yala, and the Ursera, Urs'anah and Hanaa's
#   thugs into one loop west, instead of the simulator's back-and-forth.
# - Shen'dar: Restocking the Larders is done with the Prideclaws on the
#   grasslands south of the village; the hippogryphs and the Novice Seers are
#   folded into the Western Watch trip instead of a separate trip before
#   Falaath Village.
# - Shadowgale Forest: the Strange Hermit's quests are done together with the
#   refugees' belongings, which lie in the same corner of the forest.
# - Valanaar: Mages hand Boughs in the Wind to Belann, on the way in, before
#   Elaadrin; Druids take The Great Ursera Spirit (94006) from Lotheluum with
#   Unnerving Silence (94484), in the same visit.
#
# Carried on: Journey to Sentinel Hill (98021), from Bolvar, is turned in to
# Gryan Stoutmantle at the start of the Westfall guide.
#
# The refreshed consensus export leaves the isle at about 12.2, after the
# Gustberry Lowlands, because it now runs every start on one shared route
# from level 12. This guide keeps the isle to 14.6 (the turncoat, the Shrine
# of Akir, Shadowgale Forest and the skycutter): the previous export, which
# did, reached level 20 sooner (9.4 h against 9.8 h), and it is the
# Skyborne's own story.
# Not taken: Boughs in the Wind (93797), which the new export takes, follows
# Speak with Belann (93791, Mage only) and is on Wowhead Forever's Mage page:
# a Mage quest, not one for everyone. Exploring the Alliance (93963), from
# Bolvar with Journey to Sentinel Hill, sends you to Magni and Mekkatorque in
# Ironforge and Tyrande in Darnassus: the route reaches Ironforge only in
# 06-ashenvale and Darnassus only for Druid class quests. More Al'Aketh Ears
# (93459, Vayn Moongaze) is a repeatable reputation turn-in with no XP.

